<p>I love this little blender. I use it in the morning to mix up my protein shake. I had the exact same blender for the past 5 years. Used it daily, it no longer held a charge so I bought a new one. Hope this one lasts as long. Easy to clean, usually just rinse well with very hot water. It mixes my protein shake well, no residual in the bottom. No leaks.</p>
</blockquote>
