<p>We share all this for three simple reasons. First, to highlight that these Blendjets are good for making protein shakes. Second, that bit from the Toniko review is important: this isn’t a pocket-sized Vitamix; it’s gonna mix and blend mostly stuff that’s relatively soft and pre-crushed ice.</p>
<p>But the third and most important reason: to thank you, Meh customers, for being interesting. If our forums were full of people reiterating the same basic uses for each product, we might not have lasted this long.</p>